# UETPFCore Project Skills

## Critical Architecture Patterns

### UniversalSkyActor: Manager Pattern (NOT Component Owner)
- References separately-placed actors (SkyAtmosphere, DirectionalLight, SkyLight)
- Never own atmospheric components (breaks UE5 rendering pipeline)
- Updates via subsystem queries (SolarSystemSubsystem, EnvironmentSubsystem, TimeSubsystem)
- Only owns Niagara starfield component (visual only)

### Subsystem Access Pattern
```cpp
// DO: Per-use access
UEnvironmentSubsystem* Env = GetWorld()->GetSubsystem<UEnvironmentSubsystem>();

// DON'T: Cache as UPROPERTY (can invalidate)
UPROPERTY() UEnvironmentSubsystem* CachedEnv;
```

### Coordinate Systems
- **Canonical Frame**: km-scale (physics truth, double precision)
- **UE World Frame**: cm-scale (rendering/gameplay)
- **ALWAYS** use WorldFrameSubsystem for conversions (never manual `* 100000.0`)

### Data-Driven Specs
- **UMediumSpec**: Fluid/atmosphere properties (density, viscosity, temperature)
- **USurfaceSpec**: Contact material properties (friction, compliance, hardness)
- **Load once** in InitGame/BeginPlay, register with subsystems
- **Never load in Tick**

### Delta Persistence
- Sparse cell-based storage (World Partition aligned)
- Generate deltas **only on significant changes** (not per-frame)
- Types: FSurfaceDelta, FFractureDelta, FTransformDelta

## Module Structure
```
UETPFCore (Core) → GameLauncher, SinglePlayerStoryTemplate
├── Subsystems/          # World subsystems (Time, Environment, Surface, Biome, Physics)
├── Space/Subsystems/    # GameInstance subsystems (SolarSystem, WorldFrame, StarCatalog)
├── Environment/         # UniversalSkyActor, SkyContext
├── SpecTypes.h          # Data asset definitions
└── DeltaTypes.h         # Persistence structs
```

## Build Commands
```batch
Scripts\build.bat           # Build Development Editor
Scripts\editor.bat          # Launch editor
Scripts\test.bat [filter]   # Run tests
Scripts\clean.bat           # Clean build artifacts
```

## Key Files
- ARCHITECTURE.md: Deep dive on subsystems, atmospheric rendering
- IMPLEMENTATIONGUIDE.md: Integration patterns, setup workflows
- CLAUDE.md: AI-facing architecture summary

## Current Issues
